      "observed": "On the NAVC Peripherals sheet, the BMI088 (U13) pin 5 / CSB2 is terminated with a no‑connect marker (x), while the adjacent CSB1 (pin 14) and PS (pin 7) are tied to +3.3V.",
      "expected": "The BMI088 is used in I2C mode (PS tied high, SCL/SDA on NET0154/NET0121, gyro address 0x69 per the spec). In I2C mode the datasheet requires BOTH CSB1 and CSB2 to be pulled to VDDIO; leaving CSB2 floating puts the gyroscope's interface in an undefined/SPI state.",
