        {"source": "spec", "quote": "IMU (accel + gyro) | NAVCPeripherals | Bosch BMI088, I2C addr 0x19 (acc) / 0x69 (gyr)"}
      ],
      "impact": "The gyroscope half of the IMU is not correctly configured for I2C; it may fail to acknowledge at 0x69, leaving the flight controller without gyro data (or forcing an unintended SPI mode), degrading or disabling attitude estimation.",
      "confidence": 0.5
    }
  ],
  "summary": "The build otherwise matches the specification (correct dual‑MCU parts, 5V buck / 3V3 LDO, INA219 at 0x40 with a 10 mΩ shunt, PCA9685 strapped to 0x41 to avoid a bus collision with the INA219, and the documented barometer RESET/EOC swap), but the BMI088's CSB2 pin is left as a no‑connect even though the device is wired for I2C operation, which would prevent the gyroscope from being properly enabled."
}

